compat/hdeb/ contains a bridge format ("HDEB v0.1") reconstructed independently from
publicly described lineage (exchange block orders -> flexible energy blocks). The term
appears in third-party literature; no proprietary material is included. It is kept for
migration only and is frozen; Open Envelope (envelope/) is the successor.

